WEBVTT

00:01.340 --> 00:03.800
<i>Because I refused
the Avatar's Crown,</i>

00:03.960 --> 00:08.180
<i>Canaletto was freed from the chains
that held him for 10,000 years.</i>

00:08.380 --> 00:09.890
<i>Now Oban's dying.</i>

00:10.640 --> 00:11.970
<i>And it's my fault.</i>

00:12.600 --> 00:15.680
<i>If we don't reach the Temple
of the Heart before Canaletto</i>

00:16.270 --> 00:17.480
<i>and crown me Avatar,</i>

00:18.640 --> 00:19.560
<i>all will be lost.</i>

00:21.940 --> 00:23.610
<i>My friends have stood by me.</i>

00:24.270 --> 00:26.030
<i>This is our last great challenge.</i>

00:28.740 --> 00:30.740
<i>I hope we all return.</i>

01:54.990 --> 01:57.030
Looks like we don't have
much of a choice.

01:57.200 --> 01:58.330
We don't.

02:01.580 --> 02:03.670
Molly, stand between us.

02:04.000 --> 02:06.040
We cannot let
Canaletto near you.

02:14.220 --> 02:15.760
Hang on!
Something's coming!

02:35.910 --> 02:38.620
The pyramid hasn't been activated.
Where is he?

02:38.910 --> 02:41.410
He's here all right,
in the darkness.

02:54.170 --> 02:57.140
I can't stand this.
Let's force him into the open.

02:58.220 --> 03:00.310
Molly, stay here for now.

03:00.470 --> 03:01.390
If something happens,

03:01.890 --> 03:04.060
run for the pyramid
and don't look back.

03:09.060 --> 03:10.480
Take this.

03:11.530 --> 03:13.190
It's not much but I promise,

03:13.360 --> 03:15.610
even Canaletto will feel
its royal sting.

03:18.320 --> 03:19.240
Thanks.

03:23.620 --> 03:24.330
Ready?

03:26.500 --> 03:29.210
I'll expect you
both back very soon.

04:35.690 --> 04:36.740
Jordan!

04:40.490 --> 04:41.280
Get down!

04:52.920 --> 04:53.590
Jordan?

05:01.640 --> 05:03.140
Are you all right?

05:04.180 --> 05:06.680
Don't worry about it.
It's just a scratch.

05:07.560 --> 05:08.600
Jordan...

05:13.480 --> 05:15.730
Forget me.
Go to the pyramid.

05:16.730 --> 05:17.900
Aikka will protect you.

05:20.150 --> 05:22.200
You stay here.
We won't be long.

06:18.090 --> 06:18.920
You won't escape!

06:58.500 --> 06:59.340
Aikka?

07:02.210 --> 07:02.960
Aikka!

07:06.840 --> 07:08.260
Aikka!

07:11.930 --> 07:12.810
Jordan?

07:13.100 --> 07:14.350
Jordan!

07:14.520 --> 07:16.100
Where are you?

07:18.400 --> 07:19.310
Molly...

08:18.120 --> 08:21.790
Your inner resources
never cease to amaze me.

08:22.460 --> 08:26.380
But you are destined
not to defeat me, Eva.

08:30.260 --> 08:31.680
You know my real name?

08:32.140 --> 08:36.470
I know everything
about you, my dear child.

08:36.770 --> 08:40.850
For centuries, I wove and unwove
the threads of Time,

08:41.650 --> 08:43.400
just to find you.

08:43.900 --> 08:46.070
You are my creation,

08:46.230 --> 08:47.990
my secret weapon,

08:48.150 --> 08:50.280
my most trusted pawn.

08:51.870 --> 08:52.870
But that's a lie!

08:53.660 --> 08:58.580
Deep down inside,
you know I speak the truth.

08:59.210 --> 09:03.210
Who else would have refused
the Avatar's Crown?

09:03.500 --> 09:07.920
I patiently waited in my cell
these many years,

09:08.090 --> 09:13.220
for I knew you would come,
Eva, to set me free.

09:13.430 --> 09:14.550
You're lying.

09:14.720 --> 09:16.430
I wasn't even meant to race.

09:16.720 --> 09:19.980
And yet you did, didn't you?

09:24.690 --> 09:27.570
Rick's crash, it was you.
You caused it.

09:27.980 --> 09:29.030
Yes.

09:30.990 --> 09:33.990
The human had
the potential to win

09:34.240 --> 09:37.120
but far too high
an opinion of himself

09:37.290 --> 09:40.500
to refuse the Avatar's throne.

09:41.250 --> 09:44.630
He had to be removed.

09:50.670 --> 09:52.630
You got rid of Sul, too,
didn't you?

09:53.260 --> 09:56.760
That wasn't part
of my original plan.

09:56.930 --> 09:59.100
One must improvise.

09:59.270 --> 10:02.310
The fool dared to toy
with the course of destiny.

10:03.190 --> 10:06.150
My entire plan
was in jeopardy.

10:07.940 --> 10:09.530
I've never been free.

10:09.780 --> 10:11.280
You controlled everything.

10:13.910 --> 10:17.160
You were free, Eva.

10:17.450 --> 10:21.410
The loss of your mother
and the desertion of your father

10:21.700 --> 10:24.540
created a perfect alchemy...

10:24.710 --> 10:27.880
a blazing pain within you.

10:28.040 --> 10:32.550
Once in place, I simply waited
for this flame to reach Oban

10:32.720 --> 10:35.510
and set the entire galaxy ablaze.

10:38.430 --> 10:40.470
My mother. It was you.

10:40.810 --> 10:42.560
You made her crash.

10:42.730 --> 10:44.730
You made her crash, didn't you?

10:45.480 --> 10:51.280
She had to go,
to bring out the best in you.

10:51.650 --> 10:55.740
Forget the past, Eva.

11:00.120 --> 11:03.120
This is a new beginning.

11:08.380 --> 11:12.420
Together, we will tear down
this flawed world

11:12.630 --> 11:17.680
and build a new one
full of purity.

11:17.840 --> 11:20.430
A world without pain.

11:20.600 --> 11:26.560
A changeless world of perfect
and eternal stillness.

11:29.940 --> 11:30.900
Molly...

11:31.150 --> 11:34.490
Surrender yourself to me, Eva.

11:34.650 --> 11:37.740
There is nothing to fear.

11:50.540 --> 11:51.500
No!

11:58.380 --> 12:00.050
Begone, Canaletto!

12:00.260 --> 12:01.850
You have no purpose here.

12:02.180 --> 12:03.810
You are no longer the Avatar!

12:04.180 --> 12:05.230
Enough!

12:05.390 --> 12:09.100
The Pyramid of Power has been
activated, as is required.

12:09.270 --> 12:11.770
Now fulfill your function.

12:11.940 --> 12:15.110
Give me back
the powers of Oban!

12:28.580 --> 12:29.870
Molly.

12:34.090 --> 12:35.130
<i>Jordan?</i>

12:35.840 --> 12:37.840
I... I love you Molly.

12:52.230 --> 12:53.480
No!

13:00.320 --> 13:01.240
Jordan!

13:04.240 --> 13:04.910
No!

13:31.100 --> 13:32.690
Molly?

13:33.150 --> 13:34.730
Molly, wake up.

13:41.490 --> 13:43.610
Jordan?
What happened to you?

13:43.990 --> 13:46.780
-Your body...
-That's just for show.

13:46.950 --> 13:49.790
The Creators tell me
it will wear off in a few weeks,

13:50.580 --> 13:53.000
when I've settled
into my new role.

13:53.620 --> 13:56.500
-So you're the Avatar?
-Someone had to do it.

13:59.340 --> 14:02.130
I'm so sorry.
You were never meant to.

14:02.340 --> 14:03.970
Don't worry about it.

14:04.140 --> 14:05.890
It was my own choice.

14:06.350 --> 14:09.220
I've always wanted to do
something really big in my life,

14:09.390 --> 14:12.690
but I never had the strength
to do anything on my own until now.

14:12.850 --> 14:15.100
I did this completely on my own.

14:15.520 --> 14:17.480
And let me tell you,
it's really big.

14:19.860 --> 14:22.030
It's time for me to leave now.

14:22.200 --> 14:26.070
The Creators have lots
to teach me and very little time.

14:27.620 --> 14:29.120
Jordan? I...

14:34.250 --> 14:35.250
Don't say anything.

14:38.670 --> 14:39.750
Jordan?

14:39.960 --> 14:41.590
Jordan?

14:42.220 --> 14:45.130
Take care of yourself, Molly.

15:25.590 --> 15:26.470
Aikka!

15:28.260 --> 15:30.390
Aikka, you're alive!

15:32.140 --> 15:35.140
Molly, I'm so glad you made it.

15:35.390 --> 15:37.690
But what happened
to Jordan? Is he...

15:40.980 --> 15:41.860
He's fine.

15:45.780 --> 15:47.410
Better than ever.

16:13.390 --> 16:14.600
They made it!

16:45.420 --> 16:46.510
Eva!

16:51.800 --> 16:52.890
Eva!

16:54.510 --> 16:55.810
<i>Eva...</i>

17:01.270 --> 17:02.610
Prince!

17:03.020 --> 17:04.900
Prince Aikka!

17:06.530 --> 17:09.320
<i>And so ended
the Great Race of Oban.</i>

17:13.870 --> 17:16.330
We will meet again soon,
I promise.

17:16.490 --> 17:17.870
You must see my kingdom.

17:18.250 --> 17:19.580
With great pleasure.

17:19.750 --> 17:21.460
But don't forget,
I'll be waiting.

17:23.920 --> 17:26.460
Goodbye, Molly.
Take care of yourself.

17:36.220 --> 17:38.180
<i>Jordan didn't come to see us off.</i>

17:38.470 --> 17:39.730
<i>I guess he was busy.</i>

17:40.060 --> 17:42.100
Eva, hurry LIP!

17:52.450 --> 17:53.700
<i>Goodbye, Oban.</i>

17:54.820 --> 17:55.830
<i>Goodbye, partner.</i>

17:56.660 --> 17:59.040
<i>You'll be
the best Avatar ever.</i>

18:45.880 --> 18:48.250
<i>Jordan always said
we'd get the red carpet treatment</i>

18:48.420 --> 18:49.590
<i>back on Earth.</i>

18:54.260 --> 18:56.090
<i>We got the treatment, all right.</i>

18:59.930 --> 19:01.220
<i>The powerful burst of energy</i>

19:01.560 --> 19:03.560
<i>released into the cosmos by Oban</i>

19:03.730 --> 19:06.020
<i>was felt
all the way back to Earth.</i>

19:06.730 --> 19:10.900
<i>Somehow it disabled
all of the Earth and Grog warships.</i>

19:14.240 --> 19:15.740
Everyone believes
the two enemies

19:15.860 --> 19:17.870
<i>laid down their arms
voluntarily.</i>

19:18.030 --> 19:20.990
<i>In reality, our faraway adventures
ended the war.</i>

19:21.160 --> 19:22.870
<i>But we were ordered
never to speak of it.</i>

19:23.040 --> 19:25.750
<i>The truth must remain
top secret forever.</i>

19:28.130 --> 19:31.090
<i>Stan and Koji
returned to work for Miguel.</i>

19:39.970 --> 19:40.970
<i>Don Wei?</i>

19:41.140 --> 19:43.310
<i>Well, he returned
to his sweet self</i>

19:43.470 --> 19:44.810
<i>and the racing team.</i>

19:44.980 --> 19:46.600
What are you waiting for?

19:47.190 --> 19:49.900
<i>And I returned
to school... a different one...</i>

19:50.060 --> 19:52.070
<i>nicer and closer to home.</i>

19:53.110 --> 19:55.570
<i>But still, a school.</i>

20:00.320 --> 20:03.330
<i>Some days, I feel like
none of it really happened.</i>

20:03.490 --> 20:06.410
<i>I never left Earth.
It was just a dream.</i>

20:13.750 --> 20:15.340
<i>But it wasn't a dream.</i>

20:18.470 --> 20:20.550
<i>I've got my dad back.</i>

20:23.350 --> 20:26.730
<i>I guess I was given
the Ultimate Prize after all...</i>

20:36.320 --> 20:39.490
<i>All I ever wanted was
for us to be a family again.</i>

20:44.410 --> 20:46.660
<i>And now, we are.</i>

21:14.110 --> 21:16.030
Eva? Are you OK?

21:18.110 --> 21:20.400
Yes, Dad. I'm fine.

21:23.530 --> 21:25.490
<i>Being Molly was fun.</i>

21:26.080 --> 21:28.500
<i>But it's good to be Eva again.</i>
